{"id":"583005905","kind":"article","title":"我们如何将思想工具置于有内在意义的背景中？","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zKQs1fYnn4uzdws1KZc9pxkT3NUHastcMYq"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2022-11-13","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":8,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":604,"keywords":["思想工具","间隔重复","常青笔记","情境学习","助记媒介"],"summary":"Andy Matuschak 提出，思想工具若脱离有内在意义的活动，学习练习就难以连接真实用途。他设想把间隔重复、常青笔记或抽象文章嵌入日常环境、社交互动与具体情境，让“练习”自然发生，并以 Twitter 注意力和情景化学习产品举例。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/583005905","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"MvJRQjAV\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2VjQiuiGmJ4XdM7qbB7kTAe6Ui7fFranJae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可探索的解释</a>和<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4rRX3qwSSJRsEkdXKwH2shamgHNeRthrMLiF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>很酷，但互动文章和间隔重复练习，离实际意义有很大距离：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5th5bWm6VhB6PPbYB97gUKMdnaZe5atntRza\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">赋能环境的重点是创造成长和行动的机会，而不是技能培养</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。我们如何调整这些强大工具的设计，使它们能够被置于有深刻意义的互动之中？</p><p data-pid=\"uzjZ-AJ-\">如果<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4eXdSMJFv2qVGXSUEKH4vdcHBrLHcFY1ZGfC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>的「练习环节」可以被完全删除，代之以构建一个人的真实环境，使「练习」通过日常行为自然发生呢？例如，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5UF8YjTjoYiADeLv2SeBPgKXKosK17cKfUpw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter 是一种可编程的注意力</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6yfTwYekzvBkVjeH7WBUrSAJhyGTMYDAyYW7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记维护接近于间隔重复</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>。相关笔记：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7i9vs1MyadFaSkGBSwLVsfsQ5UEdN5aS2v9J\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复系统的主流文化圈热衷无意义的目标</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"A8ZC1Sgn\">如果抽象文章可以带入社会环境中，使其具备意义，会怎么样？<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3PkZ6TRKEML864KDanxdNfzigmERKtTXppx9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">连接散文和其相关的 Twitter 对话</a></p><p data-pid=\"UfnOuakg\">如果 「学习环境」被内在地嵌入其使用环境中会怎样？例如 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z62M2Kdje6rnm6qHaQ5LSsNbc6FBNcmppbg1P\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">超级《启蒙琼林》被嵌入到一个领域中，通过情景体验来引导学习者参与</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup></p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"WuGGqFRH\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"558666521\" href=\"#/post/558666521\">助记媒介对读者的宏观影响是什么？</a></li><li data-pid=\"0eWveTdB\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"603115527\" href=\"#/post/603115527\">知识工作很少涉及刻意练习</a></li><li data-pid=\"Ldp-xf2S\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"608096379\" href=\"#/post/608096379\">§最关心的事情</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"sQRkHLJj\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 <span class=\"nolink\">Lucas-Tsui</span><br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zKQs1fYnn4uzdws1KZc9pxkT3NUHastcMYq\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">How might we situate tools for thought within intrinsically meaningful contexts? (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 助记媒介（Mnemonic medium） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 赋能环境的重点是创造成长和行动的机会，而不是技能培养 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"591395654\" href=\"#/post/591395654\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 常青笔记的维护近似于间隔重复 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"437448252\" href=\"#/post/437448252\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 间隔重复系统的主流文化圈热衷无意义的目标 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"449283714\" href=\"#/post/449283714\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 超级《启蒙琼林》被嵌入到一个领域中，通过情景体验来引导学习者参与 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"697566052\" href=\"#/post/697566052\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"582796159","title":"研究思想工具的团体需要足够的能力来建立足以用于严肃工作的原型","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":7,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"588396638","title":"大多数游戏都不是赋能环境","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":12,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"608096379","title":"§最关心的事情","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"558666521","title":"助记媒介对读者的宏观影响是什么？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"459483765","title":"助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}